<title>FINLAND: FINNISH NOV BUILDING PERMITS RISE 5 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH NOV BUILDING PERMITS RISE 5 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The construction volume for which building permits were granted rose five percent year-on-year in November to 1.7 million cubic metres, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>In January-November, the construction volume for which building permits were granted rose 23 percent year-on-year to 29.2 million cubic metres, it said.</p>
<p>Building permits for home construction rose 25 percent year-on-year in January-November to 8.4 million cubic metres, and permits for industrial buildings rose 10 percent to 5.8 million cubic metres, SF said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
